<title>UK: Tug attends soy carrier disabled off Madagascar.</title>
<headline>Tug attends soy carrier disabled off Madagascar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Liberia-flag bulker Askania Nova, disabled south of Madagascar for the past four days, is being attended by a tug, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The 52,450-dwt Askania Nova sailed from Cape Town on July 20 for Yokohama with a cargo of soy.</p>
</text>
